{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Claw & Load : Mine,Shoot,Meow!",
    "steam_appid": 3552660,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0fDual-Phase Survival: Dig or Die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is your life\u2014During Mining Phase, blast through blocks, harvest Crystals, and trigger explosive. When Combat Phase hits, relentless waves of ghouls, skeletons, and demons swarm in. Survive through tactical shooting, dodging, or letting your Mewlings\u2019 chaos reign!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/703c80f53a784b66634e3ae38cc37aa8.poster.avif?t=1746364171\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/703c80f53a784b66634e3ae38cc37aa8.webm?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/703c80f53a784b66634e3ae38cc37aa8.mp4?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e GUARDIAN MEWLINGS: Your best allies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These floating feline allies auto-attack enemies with randomly dropped weapons:Shotgun Mewlings shred at point-blank, Drone Mewlings rain explosives, and Aura Mewlings heal you! Upgrade their arms with Crystals and fuse with Relics to unlock ultimate skills: summon thunderstorms, toxic frog swarms, or screen-clearing fire tornadoe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/a37a1470576c2ec094b13e195eb64b35.poster.avif?t=1746364171\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/a37a1470576c2ec094b13e195eb64b35.webm?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/a37a1470576c2ec094b13e195eb64b35.mp4?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f ELEMENTAL CHAOS: Risk vs. Reward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with a random Climate System (Fire/Ice/Electricity/Poison).Rapid mining boosts your score to unlock buffs like firerate upgrades or meteor showers\u2014but slack off, and your advantages crumble. Will you push your luck or play it safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/2e1a0b21e334a7c3ade0736365dce0b6.poster.avif?t=1746364171\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/2e1a0b21e334a7c3ade0736365dce0b6.webm?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/2e1a0b21e334a7c3ade0736365dce0b6.mp4?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 INFINITE BUILDS: GUNS, RELICS, &amp; MADNESS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Your Gun: Unlock split-shot bullets, piercing lasers, homing missiles\u2014or transform into a walking turret!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Relics: Empower your Mewlings to shred bosses with hidden abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression: Trade Mewshrooms for upgrades , unlock skills or borrow the Queen\u2019s power mid run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Hell: No two runs alike\u2014randomized terrain, enemies, and loot keep you on edge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/532bc4ad03778eb91b2a260ce66bda82.poster.avif?t=1746364171\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/532bc4ad03778eb91b2a260ce66bda82.webm?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/532bc4ad03778eb91b2a260ce66bda82.mp4?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cMortals! My \u2018interest\u2019 in Mewshrooms is\u2026 purely academic! DIG FASTER!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eternal Night devours light but breeds magic-infused mushrooms. To earn the Queen\u2019s \u201cfavors,\u201d you delve into lethal mines, battling horrors and unearthing secrets. But beware\u2014the deeper you go, the clearer her true agenda becomes\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/f70c9d038e7033d15d281659517252c6.avif?t=1746364171\" width=429 height=453 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3c Ready to Serve?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your gun, rally the Mewlings, and dig like your life depends on it\u2014because it does!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cMY PATIENCE ENDS NOW! MEWSHROOMS. IMMEDIATELY!\u201d \u2014 Demon Cat Queen</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0fDual-Phase Survival: Dig or Die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is your life\u2014During Mining Phase, blast through blocks, harvest Crystals, and trigger explosive. When Combat Phase hits, relentless waves of ghouls, skeletons, and demons swarm in. Survive through tactical shooting, dodging, or letting your Mewlings\u2019 chaos reign!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/703c80f53a784b66634e3ae38cc37aa8.poster.avif?t=1746364171\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/703c80f53a784b66634e3ae38cc37aa8.webm?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/703c80f53a784b66634e3ae38cc37aa8.mp4?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e GUARDIAN MEWLINGS: Your best allies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These floating feline allies auto-attack enemies with randomly dropped weapons:Shotgun Mewlings shred at point-blank, Drone Mewlings rain explosives, and Aura Mewlings heal you! Upgrade their arms with Crystals and fuse with Relics to unlock ultimate skills: summon thunderstorms, toxic frog swarms, or screen-clearing fire tornadoe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/a37a1470576c2ec094b13e195eb64b35.poster.avif?t=1746364171\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552660/extras/a37a1470576c2ec094b13e195eb64b35.webm?t=1746364171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour